* MINIMIZATION
* Uebungen zu Computergrafik und Computersimulation von Biomolekuelen
* Wintersemester 2011/12, Universitaet Wien, Stefan Boresch
*

! setup the system (a blocked tryptophane)

stream minmiz_setup.str

! in order to allow visualization, let's write a psf/pdb

open unit 11 form writ name psf_coor/trp.psf
writ psf card unit 11
* blocked trp used in minmiz1.inp
*

open unit 11 form writ name psf_coor/trp_init.pdb
writ coor pdb card unit 11
* blocked trp used in minmiz1.inp, starting coors
*

! Energy of initial coordinates; use to set a huge list radius

energy cutnb 100. ihbfrq 0

! Save a copy of starting coors so that we can compute a RMS deviation
coor copy comp ! ignore details

! minimize
! As written use steepest descent (SD). Try out
! the other methods (at least one from {CONJ, ABNR, POWE}, also
! try NRAP). We do not work with the truncated Newton method (TN)

mini   sd nstep  100 inbfrq 0   nprint  1
!mini conj nstep  100 inbfrq 0   nprint  1
!mini powe nstep  100 inbfrq 0   nprint  1
!mini abnr nstep  100 inbfrq 0   nprint  1
!mini nrap nstep  100 inbfrq 0   nprint  1

coor orie rms sele all end                  ! all atoms
coor orie rms sele .not. hydrogen end       ! heavy atoms only

open unit 11 form writ name psf_coor/trp_minimized.pdb
writ coor pdb card unit 11
* blocked trp used in minmiz1.inp, after minimization
*

stop